---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Our Team & Clinical Leadership | Nepal Hypnosis"
  description="Meet the clinical practitioners and leadership at Nepal Hypnosis, including founder Archana Bibhor Dahal and Dr. Shraddha Tripathi."
>

  <!-- HERO SECTION -->
  <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-b from-[#F5F1EA] to-[#FAF8F5] pt-12 pb-14 border-b border-[#e2e8f0]">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-4xl text-center mx-auto px-4">
      <span class="text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#D84315] uppercase">
        PROFESSIONAL LEADERSHIP & FACULTY
      </span>
      <h1 class="mt-3 font-[Poppins] text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#173A7A] leading-tight">
        Clinical Leadership & Team
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-[#475569] leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Our practice is guided by experienced practitioners committed to rigorous clinical ethics, continuous professional development, and individualized, trauma-informed care.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MAIN TEAM SECTION -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white border-b border-[#e2e8f0]">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-6xl px-4 space-y-16">
      
      <!-- 1. ARCHANA BIBHOR DAHAL (FOUNDER & LEAD PSYCHOTHERAPIST) -->
      <article class="bg-[#FAF8F5] p-6 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-[#e2e8f0] shadow-sm">
        
        <!-- Header & Image Layout -->
        <div class="grid items-start gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.75fr_1.25fr]">
          
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="relative">
              <img 
                src="/images/archana-bibhor1.png" 
                alt="Archana Bibhor Dahal - Founder & Lead Psychotherapist" 
                width="400" 
                height="400" 
                class="w-full rounded-2xl shadow-md object-cover max-w-[340px] mx-auto border border-[#e2e8f0] bg-white" 
              />
              <div class="absolute -bottom-3 -right-3 hidden sm:block bg-[#173A7A] text-white px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold shadow-md">
                Est. 2012 Practitioner
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Key Metadata Box -->
            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e8f0] text-xs font-semibold space-y-2.5 text-[#173A7A]">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-2 border-b border-[#f1f5f9]">
                <span class="text-[#64748b] font-normal uppercase text-[10px] tracking-wider">Location</span>
                <span>Kathmandu, Nepal</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-2 border-b border-[#f1f5f9]">
                <span class="text-[#64748b] font-normal uppercase text-[10px] tracking-wider">Languages</span>
                <span>Nepali, English</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                <span class="text-[#64748b] font-normal uppercase text-[10px] tracking-wider">Therapy Mode</span>
                <span>In-Person & Online Video</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Quick Action -->
            <a href="https://portal.nepalhypnosis.com/form/consultation-request" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#D84315] px-6 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-white shadow-md hover:bg-[#b93812] transition">
              Request Consultation with Archana →
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Narrative Biography -->
          <div class="space-y-5">
            <div>
              <span class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#D84315]">Founder & Clinical Leadership</span>
              <h2 class="mt-1 text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#173A7A]">Archana Bibhor Dahal</h2>
              <p class="text-base font-bold text-[#385BAA]">Founder & Lead Psychotherapist</p>
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#64748b] uppercase tracking-wider">Trainer | PsyD Candidate in Clinical Psychology</p>
            </div>

            <div class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#475569] leading-relaxed space-y-4 font-normal">
              <p>
                Archana Bibhor Dahal is the Founder and Lead Psychotherapist of Nepal Hypnosis Clinic and Training Center, established in Kathmandu in 2012. With nearly two decades of professional experience in psychotherapy, counselling, mental health education, and practitioner training, she has developed a practice grounded in individualized, eclectic, and trauma-informed care.
              </p>
              <p>
                Her clinical work draws on a range of therapeutic approaches, including Gestalt psychotherapy, clinical hypnotherapy, psychosocial counselling, cognitive behavioural approaches, and trauma-informed interventions. Rather than applying a single method to every client, she emphasizes understanding each person's experiences, relationships, strengths, circumstances, and therapeutic goals before determining an appropriate course of intervention.
              </p>
              <p>
                Archana has also worked extensively in professional education and mental health training. From 2017 to 2022, she facilitated postgraduate Gestalt psychotherapy training through the Gestalt Institute of Nepal. Through Nepal Hypnosis, she has delivered more than 500 hours of training in counselling skills, hypnotherapy, self-care, and related areas for psychology students and practitioners.
              </p>
              <p>
                Her professional experience includes crisis intervention and disaster mental health. Following the 2015 earthquake in Nepal, she contributed to mental health response activities and provided Psychological First Aid (PFA) to affected communities and institutions. Her broader work has included psychosocial support, staff wellbeing, trauma-informed practice, and mental health programmes for organizations.
              </p>
              <p>
                Archana is currently pursuing a Doctor of Psychology (PsyD) in Clinical Psychology at United States International University–Africa (USIU-Africa). She has completed her doctoral coursework and is undertaking her doctoral internship at the Department of Psychiatry and Mental Health, Tribhuvan University Teaching Hospital (TUTH), Maharajgunj, alongside her dissertation. She holds Master's and Bachelor's degrees in Psychology from Tribhuvan University, Nepal.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Credibility Indicators Panel -->
        <div class="mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-[#e2e8f0] grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-center">
          <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e8f0]">
            <div class="text-2xl font-black text-[#173A7A]">Nearly 20</div>
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#64748b] mt-0.5">Years Experience</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e8f0]">
            <div class="text-2xl font-black text-[#D84315]">500+</div>
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#64748b] mt-0.5">Training Hours Delivered</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e8f0]">
            <div class="text-2xl font-black text-[#173A7A]">Since 2012</div>
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#64748b] mt-0.5">Clinic Founder</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e8f0]">
            <div class="text-2xl font-black text-[#385BAA]">PsyD</div>
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#64748b] mt-0.5">Doctoral Candidate</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Structured Professional Profile Grid -->
        <div class="mt-8 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-xs text-[#475569]">
          
          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e8f0] space-y-3">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-[#173A7A] uppercase tracking-wider border-b border-[#f1f5f9] pb-2">Areas of Practice</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-4 font-medium">
              <li>Individual psychotherapy and counselling</li>
              <li>Gestalt psychotherapy</li>
              <li>Clinical hypnotherapy</li>
              <li>Trauma-informed practice &amp; recovery</li>
              <li>Psychosocial counselling</li>
              <li>Psychological First Aid (PFA) and crisis response</li>
              <li>Mental health education and practitioner training</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e8f0] space-y-3">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-[#173A7A] uppercase tracking-wider border-b border-[#f1f5f9] pb-2">Academic & Clinical Development</h3>
            <div class="space-y-2 font-medium">
              <div>
                <span class="font-bold text-[#173A7A] block">Doctor of Psychology (PsyD) in Clinical Psychology</span>
                <span>USIU-Africa, Nairobi (Coursework completed; dissertation ongoing)</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <span class="font-bold text-[#173A7A] block">Doctoral Internship</span>
                <span>Dept. of Psychiatry &amp; Mental Health, Tribhuvan University Teaching Hospital (TUTH), Maharajgunj</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <span class="font-bold text-[#173A7A] block">MA &amp; BA in Psychology</span>
                <span>Tribhuvan University, Nepal</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

      </article>

      <!-- 2. SHRADDHA TRIPATHI, PsyD -->
      <article class="bg-[#FAF8F5] p-6 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-[#e2e8f0] shadow-sm">
        
        <div class="grid items-start gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.75fr_1.25fr]">
          
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="relative">
              <img 
                src="/images/shraddha-tripathi.png" 
                alt="Shraddha Tripathi, PsyD - Clinical Associate" 
                width="400" 
                height="400" 
                class="w-full rounded-2xl shadow-md object-cover max-w-[340px] mx-auto border border-[#e2e8f0] bg-white" 
              />
              <div class="absolute -bottom-3 -right-3 hidden sm:block bg-[#173A7A] text-white px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold shadow-md">
                Online Telehealth
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Key Metadata Box -->
            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e8f0] text-xs font-semibold space-y-2.5 text-[#173A7A]">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-2 border-b border-[#f1f5f9]">
                <span class="text-[#64748b] font-normal uppercase text-[10px] tracking-wider">Location</span>
                <span>Dubai, UAE</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-2 border-b border-[#f1f5f9]">
                <span class="text-[#64748b] font-normal uppercase text-[10px] tracking-wider">Languages</span>
                <span>Hindi, English</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                <span class="text-[#64748b] font-normal uppercase text-[10px] tracking-wider">Therapy Mode</span>
                <span>Online Video Consultation</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <a href="https://portal.nepalhypnosis.com/form/consultation-request" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#D84315] px-6 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-white shadow-md hover:bg-[#b93812] transition">
              Request Consultation with Sharaddha →
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-5">
            <div>
              <span class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#D84315]">Clinical Associate</span>
              <h2 class="mt-1 text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#173A7A]">Sharaddha Tripathi, PsyD</h2>
              <p class="text-base font-bold text-[#385BAA]">Clinical Psychologist</p>
            </div>

            <div class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#475569] leading-relaxed space-y-4 font-normal">
              <p>
                Dr. Sharaddha Tripathi brings advanced doctoral training in clinical psychology from USIU-Africa. Based in Dubai, UAE, she specializes in providing evidence-informed, culturally sensitive online psychotherapy to individuals and couples navigating relationship dynamics, life transitions, and emotional wellbeing across international jurisdictions.
              </p>
              <p>
                Her therapeutic work emphasizes person-centered counselling, psychosocial support, and mindfulness-informed strategies within a warm, non-judgmental space that supports personal growth and resilience.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e8f0] space-y-3 text-xs text-[#475569]">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-[#173A7A] uppercase tracking-wider border-b border-[#f1f5f9] pb-2">Qualifications &amp; Practice Focus</h3>
              <ul class="space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-4 font-medium">
                <li>Doctor of Psychology (PsyD) in Clinical Psychology — USIU-Africa</li>
                <li>Individual &amp; couples counselling and relationship dynamics</li>
                <li>Distance and telehealth psychotherapy for international clients</li>
                <li>Mindfulness-based interventions and emotional regulation</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>

      </article>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PRACTICE STANDARDS -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-[#FAF8F5]">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-4xl text-center px-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#173A7A]">Our Practice Standards</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-[#475569] leading-relaxed">
        At Nepal Hypnosis, our therapeutic team operates under rigorous standards of confidentiality, evidence-informed care, and professional supervision. We believe in collaborative, respectful, and non-judgmental mental healthcare.
      </p>
      
      <div class="mt-10 grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-left">
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e8f0] shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-[#173A7A] text-base mb-2">Confidentiality</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#475569] leading-relaxed">Strict adherence to client privacy and professional ethical boundaries.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e8f0] shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-[#173A7A] text-base mb-2">Eclectic Approach</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#475569] leading-relaxed">Tailoring therapeutic modalities to fit each individual's unique needs and goals.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e8f0] shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-[#173A7A] text-base mb-2">Continuous Learning</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#475569] leading-relaxed">Active participation in ongoing academic research, clinical supervision, and training.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FINAL CTA -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-[#173A7A] text-center text-white">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold sm:text-4xl">Ready to begin your journey?</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-blue-100 text-base leading-relaxed">
        Whether you are seeking individual psychotherapy or exploring professional training, we are here to support you.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="https://portal.nepalhypnosis.com/form/consultation-request" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="rounded-xl bg-[#D84315] px-8 py-3.5 text-[15px] font-bold text-white shadow-md hover:bg-[#b93812] transition">
          Request a Consultation
        </a>
        <a href="/clinical-standards" class="rounded-xl bg-white/10 px-8 py-3.5 text-[15px] font-bold text-white hover:bg-white/20 transition border border-white/20">
          Read Clinical Standards
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>